@ai = http://127.0.0.1:8084
@userJwt = replace-with-out-of-band-valid-USER-JWT

### Requires AI/RAG/Agent enabled, explicit provider config, imported owner documents, and consent.
### Fixture expected 200 ANSWERED with 2 calls/1 tool; empty tenant 200 NO_EVIDENCE; restart clears evidence.
POST {{ai}}/api/ai/agent/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"How long are deleted files kept in the recycle bin?","allowExternalProcessing":true}

### Same prerequisites; consent false must return 400 AI_INPUT_INVALID before model/Agent telemetry.
POST {{ai}}/api/ai/agent/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"test","allowExternalProcessing":false}

### No caller-supplied owner; expect 400 AI_INPUT_INVALID and zero external calls.
POST {{ai}}/api/ai/agent/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"test","allowExternalProcessing":true,"ownerId":8}

### Metrics stay unexposed and denied: authenticated USER 403, anonymous 401. No new management endpoint.
GET {{ai}}/actuator/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
